# Accepted vulnerability findings for the Spark image (the vulnerability gate,
# docs/deployment/release-images.md). Trivy's own syntax, so a local `trivy image`
# honours it too. Every entry needs, directly above it with no blank line between:
#
#   # reason: why the finding is accepted (for example, not reachable from Spark)
#   # accepted-by: the person accepting it
#   CVE-YYYY-NNNNN exp:YYYY-MM-DD
#
# The gate fails on an entry without a reason, a person or an expiry, on one listed
# twice, and on one whose expiry date has passed, whether or not the finding is still
# present. Remove an entry once the finding is fixed. There are no entries yet.
